{"id":"sh/65g3298r","kind":"textbox","text":"Product Overview","position":{"left":98,"top":170,"width":1080,"height":26}}
{"id":"sh/ts7md4r2","kind":"textbox","text":"Compass helps members make progress through care with grounded answers, permissioned outreach, and continuity across member-owned journeys.","position":{"left":98,"top":204,"width":1090,"height":55}}
{"id":"sh/sryl4zqx","kind":"textbox","text":"The customer and problem","position":{"left":98,"top":286,"width":506,"height":28}}
{"id":"sh/fu94fe98","kind":"textbox","text":"Members piece together benefits, claims, providers, medications, and care plans across disconnected channels. Every handoff can lose context and stall progress.","position":{"left":98,"top":320,"width":506,"height":74}}
{"id":"sh/utg3698n","kind":"textbox","text":"The solution","position":{"left":674,"top":286,"width":506,"height":28}}
{"id":"sh/wn6dc7eh","kind":"textbox","text":"Surfaces (Member, CSR, Provider) → Spine (Auth, Agent Broker, AI Agents) → Brain (governed knowledge). Journeys carry goals, events, choices, next steps, and human help.","position":{"left":674,"top":320,"width":506,"height":74}}
{"id":"sh/hofulsf2","kind":"textbox","text":"The value proposition","position":{"left":98,"top":416,"width":506,"height":28}}
{"id":"sh/ul4vaxgb","kind":"textbox","text":"From answer engine to advocate, navigator, and companion: grounded resolution, visible progress, fewer restarts, and trust earned over time.","position":{"left":98,"top":450,"width":506,"height":74}}
{"id":"sh/5sfepcfe","kind":"textbox","text":"Roadmap and next step","position":{"left":98,"top":554,"width":1080,"height":28}}
{"id":"sh/ipovexwn","kind":"textbox","text":"M0 journey foundation → Eligibility → Claims → Accumulators → Formulary → Provider Lookup → Scheduling. Validate each as a whole journey increment; rebaseline delivery scope before commitment.","position":{"left":98,"top":588,"width":1080,"height":60}}
{"id":"sh/3qxwn2x8","kind":"textbox","text":"The alternative today","position":{"left":674,"top":418.77,"width":506,"height":28}}
{"id":"sh/sfqdkrep","kind":"textbox","text":"Transaction-by-transaction portals, chats, and calls can address an immediate need without carrying the member’s goal, permissions, and context across care.","position":{"left":674,"top":452.77,"width":506,"height":74}}
{"id":"im/mh4v6dwr","kind":"image","position":{"left":1129,"top":657,"width":113,"height":27}}
{"id":"sh/wzqxgb2l","kind":"textbox","text":"Six questions to shape Compass","position":{"left":92,"top":72,"width":1100,"height":58}}
{"id":"sh/byhw76l0","kind":"textbox","text":"Start with member value and trust; let evidence define the boundaries for memory, action, and coordination.","position":{"left":98,"top":170,"width":1080,"height":58}}
{"id":"sh/ax8fe1kf","kind":"textbox","text":"01","position":{"left":98,"top":254,"width":42,"height":32}}
{"id":"sh/54jydg32","kind":"textbox","text":"What first member moment should Compass help carry forward—not merely answer?","position":{"left":146,"top":252,"width":458,"height":59}}
{"id":"sh/k3axkb2h","kind":"textbox","text":"Find the next meaningful step and member outcome.","position":{"left":146,"top":314,"width":458,"height":35}}
{"id":"sh/j2hgb6lw","kind":"textbox","text":"02","position":{"left":674,"top":254,"width":42,"height":32}}
{"id":"sh/y18fi1kb","kind":"textbox","text":"What must a conversation do to earn trust?","position":{"left":722,"top":252,"width":458,"height":59}}
{"id":"sh/18fehc3y","kind":"textbox","text":"Test evidence, uncertainty, privacy, and correction.","position":{"left":722,"top":314,"width":458,"height":35}}
{"id":"sh/076x8r2d","kind":"shape","position":{"left":98,"top":355,"width":506,"height":1}}
{"id":"sh/y9gjel0z","kind":"textbox","text":"03","position":{"left":98,"top":367,"width":42,"height":32}}
{"id":"sh/zupk7qhk","kind":"textbox","text":"What should Compass remember as a member-owned journey?","position":{"left":146,"top":365,"width":458,"height":59}}
{"id":"sh/kvi1gvi5","kind":"textbox","text":"Define goals, events, barriers, and member control.","position":{"left":146,"top":427,"width":458,"height":35}}
{"id":"sh/lwr290zq","kind":"shape","position":{"left":674,"top":355,"width":506,"height":1}}
{"id":"sh/mx0ji50v","kind":"textbox","text":"04","position":{"left":674,"top":367,"width":42,"height":32}}
{"id":"sh/7y9kbahg","kind":"textbox","text":"When may Compass reach out or act?","position":{"left":722,"top":365,"width":458,"height":59}}
{"id":"sh/8zi1kfi1","kind":"textbox","text":"Set outreach, standing-approval, and fresh-consent limits.","position":{"left":722,"top":427,"width":458,"height":35}}
{"id":"sh/90r2dkzm","kind":"shape","position":{"left":98,"top":468,"width":506,"height":1}}
{"id":"sh/u10jmp07","kind":"textbox","text":"05","position":{"left":98,"top":480,"width":42,"height":32}}
{"id":"sh/v2tkfahs","kind":"textbox","text":"How does continuity survive a change of surface or a human intervention?","position":{"left":146,"top":478,"width":458,"height":59}}
{"id":"sh/r6t03uxk","kind":"textbox","text":"Carry context across Member, CSR, Provider, and human help.","position":{"left":146,"top":540,"width":458,"height":35}}
{"id":"sh/q5kjapwf","kind":"shape","position":{"left":674,"top":468,"width":506,"height":1}}
{"id":"sh/dsbi5kfq","kind":"textbox","text":"06","position":{"left":674,"top":480,"width":42,"height":32}}
{"id":"sh/s721cfe5","kind":"textbox","text":"What would show that Compass is becoming a trusted companion?","position":{"left":722,"top":478,"width":458,"height":59}}
{"id":"sh/32t0zaxo","kind":"textbox","text":"Measure progress and trust alongside quality and safety.","position":{"left":722,"top":540,"width":458,"height":35}}
